          },
          {
            "local_name": "custody",
            "role": "candidate",
            "introduced_at": 2,
            "definition": "reality-facing meaning may be carried by a protocol-bound custody chain: a formal claim is grounded only when independent observers can remeasure an explicit external coordinate, while resistance to destruction requires separately auditable integrity, authenticity, availability, fork-accountability, and recovery mechanisms across independent failure domains"
          },
          {
            "local_name": "arithmetic-universality",
            "role": "candidate",
            "introduced_at": 3,
            "definition": "Mingli Yuan proposes arithmetic universality: finite arithmetic syntax and finite witnessed computation may provide a common constructive presentation for task-relative languages, with additive-zero and multiplicative-unit boundary questions supplied by the opposite hypothesis named hypothesized-arithmetic-truth. The class of languages, translation, preservation relation, and universal property remain to be specified and proved."
          },
          {
            "local_name": "hypothesized-arithmetic-truth",
            "role": "candidate",
            "introduced_at": 4,
            "definition": "Mingli Yuan proposes hypothesized arithmetic truth as the opposite boundary to arithmetic-universality: an as-yet-unproved additive-zero and multiplicative-unit condition can delimit a constructive arithmetic question. Its occurrence remains a hypothesis until the declared checker supplies an appropriately typed, scoped witness; local discharge does not establish universality or close the open M6 relation."
          }
